    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Approaching the moustached man's table with eyes averted, Max invents one excuse after another—from a problem with his room to a parked car outside—to make him leave the dining room. When Max accidentally looks into his eyes and feels nothing, he tackles the man.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
